CRITICAL ARCHITECTURE FEATURE

All UI changes must propagate to markdown files:
- TUI edit → store.updateNode() → SQLite → Sync writes to .md
- File edit → Watcher → Parser → Model diffs → UI re-renders

sync= rule: moving task to column sets field, field change writes to file.

Package: km-store + km-watch
Files: Model layer triggers sync layer

